THIRD-PARTY CODE SETS AND REFERENCE DATA
----------------------------------------

This repository ships database schema for storing procedure and diagnosis
codes. It does not ship the code sets themselves, and deliberately so:

  - CDT procedure codes are copyrighted by the American Dental Association.
  - CPT procedure codes are copyrighted by the American Medical Association.

Both require a licence from their respective owners. Obtain one and load the
codes into your own installation; do not commit them to a public fork.

CARC and RARC claim adjustment and remark codes are published openly by X12 and
the Washington Publishing Company, and the schema for them is populated by a
migration in this repository.


